OL,3,GNEWSAOxford college considers buying
OL,4,Aback 125-year-old barge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA University of Oxford college has
OL,7,Fconfirmed it has been offered the
OL,8,Fchance to buy back its 125-year-old
OL,9,Fformer rowing barge.
OL,11,FNew College said its governors had
OL,12,Fdiscussed the offer to purchase the
OL,13,Fbarge for #290,000 from the vessel's
OL,14,Fcurrent owner Julius Just at a meeting
OL,15,Fon Wednesday.
OL,17,FDuring the golden era of Oxford rowing,
OL,18,Fin the 1940s, there were as many as 26
OL,19,Fcollege rowing barges. Today, only six
OL,20,Fremain afloat and most are privately
OL,21,Fowned.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
